 SPI, regmap, MFD, input and threaded interrupts, IIO, generic GPIO chips, ASoC codecs and
 cards, i.MX clocks and pins, and USB host controllers, which 7.3 has none of, so that the
 drivers ported to Rust need no unsafe code of their own: it's all here, each block with
 its reason.
